{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Vv6ERnPLWO1794213835.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>邵德龍（邵師傅）曾示範鮮鮑魚紅燒肉，這道菜式結合了新鮮鮑魚與甘香的五花肉，不僅造型精緻、滋味豐富，絕對是宴客時驚艷全場的必備大菜。 </p><p>鮮鮑魚紅燒肉材料</p><ul><li><p>帶皮五花腩 900g</p></li><li><p>六頭南非鮮鮑魚 6隻</p></li><li><p>鴿蛋 10隻</p></li><li><p>老薑 60g</p></li><li><p>紅頭玉蔥 30g</p></li></ul><p><strong>調味料：</strong></p><ul><li><p>生油 60ml</p></li><li><p>生抽 20ml</p></li><li><p>老抽 8ml</p></li><li><p>冰糖 30g</p></li><li><p>砂糖 25g</p></li><li><p>花雕酒 200ml</p></li><li><p>八角 5g</p></li><li><p>桂皮 5g</p></li><li><p>草果 5g</p></li><li><p>香葉 3g</p></li></ul><h3>鮮鮑魚紅燒肉做法</h3><ol><li><p>五花腩肉洗淨改粗條狀。</p></li><li><p>鮮鮑魚劏好、洗淨、𠝹花。</p></li><li><p>鴿蛋煮熟剝殼備用。</p></li><li><p>起鑊燒熱落油、五花腩乾煸上色、落薑蔥、酒。</p></li><li><p>後下生抽、鮮鮑魚、香料一齊慢火煮。</p></li><li><p>另一邊起鑊燒熱、加油、冰糖及清水炒至焦糖色，加到炆煮中的鮑魚腩肉中上糖色，最後加些砂糖再炆煮40分鐘。</p></li><li><p>最後加入鴿蛋炆至汁能掛上肉上即可。</p></li></ol><p><p><img alt=\"3f0bab9d-3f97-4c1b-be96-53fd54949fcb.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026LwawlZrYlE1794213834.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>烹調小貼士</p><ul><li><p><strong>切花刀提靚</strong>：新鮮鮑魚先切花刀，炆好後形狀更美觀。</p></li><li><p><strong>煎肉去膩添香</strong>：五花肉下鍋先用慢火煎至外表略帶金黃焦香，燜煮時不僅更香，顏色也會特別好看。</p></li><li><p><strong>香料處理</strong>：草果可以稍微拍一下，讓香氣更容易揮發入味。</p></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.609195+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":455,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:39.605430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:14.050394+00:00","content_hash":"d0e8da4ff56898154cdaf23b0bc7655bf7a12eb8012314f9bb85d16759b11880","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.609195+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}